nvey the extreme heat of the chips"},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"03.webp","w":2000,"h":2000},{"f":"04.webp","w":2000,"h":2000}]},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"Campaign Goals\n\nAwareness: Achieve 1M impressions across all platforms.\nEngagement: Increase likes, comments, and shares by 25%.\nSales: Boost sales of Herr’s Ghost Pepper Chips by 20% during the campaign period."},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"05.webp","w":2000,"h":2000},{"f":"06.webp","w":2000,"h":2000}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"07.webp","w":3000,"h":1050}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"08.gif","w":1920,"h":1313}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"09.webp","w":3000,"h":1050}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"10.webp","w":2000,"h":2000},{"f":"11.webp","w":2000,"h":2000}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"12.webp","w":3000,"h":1050}]}],"pal":{"dom":"#DD1309","accent":"#2BE5EE","dark":"#000000","light":"#EBEFF0","onDom":"#FFF7FB","onAccent":"#14121A","swatches":["#104F7B","#000000","#A8BCBD","#940204","#00040A","#132133"]}},{"id":"191951149","title":"Skate Marketplace — Brand Identity & Web Design","cat":"branding","url":"https://www.behance.net/gallery/191951149/Brand-Identity-Web-design-Skate-Marketplace","images":[{"f":"01.webp","t":"01_t.webp","w":3299,"h":2328},{"f":"02.webp","t":"02_t.webp","w":3840,"h":2160},{"f":"03.webp","t":"03_t.webp","w":3840,"h":2160},{"f":"04_anim.webp","t":"04_t.webp","w":1400,"h":788},{"f":"05.webp","t":"05_t.webp","w":3709,"h":2554},{"f":"06.webp","t":"06_t.webp","w":2995,"h":1670},{"f":"07.webp","t":"07_t.webp","w":2995,"h":1670},{"f":"08.webp","t":"08_t.webp","w":2995,"h":1670},{"f":"09.gif","t":"09_t.webp","w":2995,"h":1670},{"f":"10.gif","t":"10_t.webp","w":3840,"h":2160},{"f":"11_anim.webp","t":"11_t.webp","w":927,"h":1400},{"f":"12.webp","t":"12_t.webp","w":1298,"h":2539},{"f":"13.webp","t":"13_t.webp","w":3840,"h":5190},{"f":"14.webp","t":"14_t.webp","w":3704,"h":4866},{"f":"15.webp","t":"15_t.webp","w":1298,"h":2539},{"f":"16.gif","t":"16_t.webp","w":3704,"h":4866},{"f":"17.webp","t":"17_t.webp","w":3840,"h":2160},{"f":"18.webp","t":"18_t.webp","w":3840,"h":2160},{"f":"19.webp","t":"19_t.webp","w":3840,"h":2160},{"f":"20.webp","t":"20_t.webp","w":1080,"h":1920},{"f":"21.webp","t":"21_t.webp","w":1080,"h":1920},{"f":"22.webp","t":"22_t.webp","w":1080,"h":1920},{"f":"23.webp","t":"23_t.webp","w":3840,"h":2160},{"f":"24.webp","t":"24_t.webp","w":3840,"h":11803},{"f":"25.webp","t":"25_t.webp","w":3840,"h":2160},{"f":"26.webp","t":"26_t.webp","w":3840,"h":2160}],"cover":{"f":"cover.webp","w":808,"h":632},"mods":[{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"01.webp","w":3299,"h":2328}]},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"FROM CONCEPT TO COMPLETION\nFrom brand strategy to the full brand identity, logo design, colors, fonts, illustrations, icons, web design, social media designs, copywriting... all the graphics\n\nSkate Marketplace Full Brand Identity - logo design\n&\nOn-Brand Engaging Graphics For A Variety Of Media Maintaining The Brand Across All Marketing Channels"},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"02.webp","w":3840,"h":2160}]},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"Project Overview\nTarget Audience:-\nSkate Community (Merchants and consumers)\n\nObjectives:-\nSince this market is very chaotic, the brand's main goal is to simplify the process by connecting all the customers and trusted sellers in one organized marketplace"},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"I choose to go with the slogan : (let's keep It simple)  to recall the brand experience\n\nAnd the calm fantasy look and feel for the logo and the creative direction since it is the most appealing for this target audience\n\nbrings them into an experience in a different imaginary world\n\nAlso to create a calm and relaxing experience to build trust with our customers"},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"03.webp","w":3840,"h":2160}]},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"Hero Section\n\nI wanted to go with a very relatable background for the hero section of the website so customers can relate and engage with the brand immediately\n\nTherefore, I chose to create a design that combines all the activities and vibes in the skate community\n\nAnd that was the real challenge here since it is very complicated to gather all of that in one design without being visually annoying, not to mention the composition itself\n​​​​​​​"},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"Design Process"},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"04_anim.webp","w":1400,"h":788}]},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"Customization for different screen sizes is an essential step"},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"05.webp","w":3709,"h":2554}]},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"Samples Of The Icons Designs"},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"06.webp","w":2995,"h":1670}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"07.webp","w":2995,"h":1670}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"08.webp","w":2995,"h":1670}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"09.gif","w":2995,"h":1670}]},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"Some Of The Design Elements\nSince I have a strong attention to detail, most of the designs elements have been designed separately"},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"10.gif","w":3840,"h":2160}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"11_anim.webp","w":927,"h":1400},{"f":"12.webp","w":1298,"h":2539}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"13.webp","w":3840,"h":5190}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"14.webp","w":3704,"h":4866}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"15.webp","w":1298,"h":2539},{"f":"16.gif","w":3704,"h":4866}]},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"Some Of The Website Pages Designs & Copywriting\nSince I have great experience in copywriting, along with designs I wrote the whole website copies"},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"17.webp","w":3840,"h":2160}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"18.webp","w":3840,"h":2160}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"19.webp","w":3840,"h":2160}]},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"Maintain brand consistency across all channels"},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"20.webp","w":1080,"h":1920},{"f":"21.webp","w":1080,"h":1920},{"f":"22.webp","w":1080,"h":1920}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"23.webp","w":3840,"h":2160}]},{"t"