ear in message."},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"05.webp","w":1408,"h":768}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"06.webp","w":1080,"h":1080},{"f":"07.webp","w":1080,"h":1080}]},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"I believe the best ads are the ones that stick in your mind after a single frame.\nHere, we let imagination deliver the message – literally.\nIf you enjoyed the concept, feel free to share or reach out!"},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"Thanks"}],"pal":{"dom":"#AB6C49","accent":"#2BA8EE","dark":"#010103","light":"#F4EFE7","onDom":"#FFF7FB","onAccent":"#FFF7FB","swatches":["#333234","#201616","#DAC9AF","#76412F","#01091B","#010103"]}},{"id":"209067071","title":"The Wild Is Yours — Car Advertising","cat":"advertising","url":"https://www.behance.net/gallery/209067071/Car-Advertising-_The-Wild-Is-Yours","images":[{"f":"01.webp","t":"01_t.webp","w":2800,"h":3007},{"f":"02.webp","t":"02_t.webp","w":2500,"h":532},{"f":"03.webp","t":"03_t.webp","w":2500,"h":658},{"f":"04.webp","t":"04_t.webp","w":2500,"h":472},{"f":"05.webp","t":"05_t.webp","w":2500,"h":817},{"f":"06.webp","t":"06_t.webp","w":2500,"h":322},{"f":"07.webp","t":"07_t.webp","w":2500,"h":817},{"f":"08.webp","t":"08_t.webp","w":2500,"h":649}],"cover":{"f":"cover.webp","w":808,"h":632},"mods":[{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"01.webp","w":2800,"h":3007}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"02.webp","w":2500,"h":532}]},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"Objective"},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"To create a visually striking and memorable car ad that effectively communicates the vehicle’s power, speed, and control in wild environments, while reinforcing its capability to dominate even the most rugged terrains. The ad's theme should appeal to adventurous, thrill-seeking customers who value performance, durability, and design"},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"03.webp","w":2500,"h":658}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"04.webp","w":2500,"h":472}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"05.webp","w":2500,"h":817}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"06.webp"