behance.net/gallery/231241201/Visual-Campaign-for-an-Eye-Clinic-Roaya-","images":[{"f":"01.webp","t":"01_t.webp","w":1400,"h":183},{"f":"02.webp","t":"02_t.webp","w":1300,"h":1857},{"f":"03.webp","t":"03_t.webp","w":1300,"h":1857},{"f":"04.webp","t":"04_t.webp","w":1024,"h":1024},{"f":"05.webp","t":"05_t.webp","w":1024,"h":1024},{"f":"06.webp","t":"06_t.webp","w":1080,"h":1543},{"f":"07.webp","t":"07_t.webp","w":1200,"h":1714},{"f":"08.webp","t":"08_t.webp","w":1200,"h":1714}],"cover":{"f":"cover.webp","w":808,"h":632},"mods":[{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"01.webp","w":1400,"h":183}]},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"Visual Campaign for an Eye Clinic"},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"🟦 Overview | نظرة عامة\n\nThis creative campaign was developed for Roaya Eye Center, a leading Saudi eye clinic specialized in ophthalmology and laser vision correction. The campaign aims to raise awareness about serious eye conditions—like glaucoma (المياه الزرقاء) and cataracts (المياه البيضاء)—and encourage early screening and treatment."},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"🎯 Objective | الهدف\n\nTo grab attention through emotional, dramatic, and metaphorical visuals that:\n• Warn about the silent damage caused by glaucoma.\n• Encourage timely eye checkups before symptoms appear.\n• Promote laser vision correction as a way to reclaim freedom and clarity."},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"🖼️ Concept & Visual Style\n\nThe visuals mix realism, symbolism, and cartoonish exaggeration to reflect both the seriousness of the condition and the hope in effective treatment."},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"02.webp","w":1300,"h":1857},{"f":"03.webp","w":1300,"h":1857}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"04.webp","w":1024,"h":1024},{"f":"05.webp","w":1024,"h":1024}]},{"t":"img","items":[{"f":"06.webp","w":1080,"h":1543},{"f":"07.webp","w":1200,"h":1714},{"f":"08.webp","w":1200,"h":1714}]},{"t":"text","align":"center","text":"Thanks"}],"pal":{"dom":"#3F8AA6","accent":"#EE5F2B","dark":"#000000","lig